OL,3,AAnthony Joshua's driver attempted
OL,4,Aovertake before fatal crash, trial
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe driver of a car carrying Anthony
OL,8,FJoshua was attempting to overtake
OL,9,Fanother vehicle when it crashed,
OL,10,Fkilling two of the boxer's friends, a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FAdeniyi Mobolaji Kayode, 46, faces
OL,14,Fcharges including causing death by
OL,15,Fdangerous driving and driving without a
OL,16,Fvalid national driver's licence. He
OL,17,Fdenies the charges.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
