OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAnthony Joshua's driver attempted
OL,4,Aovertake before fatal crash, trial
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe court was told that the group - who
OL,8,Fhad been travelling to visit Joshua's
OL,9,Ffather in Ogun State, near Lagos in
OL,10,FNigeria, last December - were asleep
OL,11,Fwhen Kayode lost control of his Lexus
OL,12,FSUV while he overtook a moving truck
OL,13,Fand collided with a parked lorry.
OL,15,FJoshua's personal trainer, Latif
OL,16,FAyodele, and strength coach, Sina
OL,17,FGhami, died in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
